OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners raise concern over
OL,4,A#100m redevelopment
OL,5,
OL,6,FOpponents of a proposed #100m
OL,7,Fredevelopment of a town centre fear
OL,8,Fhundreds of new homes and a loss of
OL,9,Fparking spaces could deter shoppers and
OL,10,Fvisitors.
OL,12,FCapital&Centric plans to build new
OL,13,Fshops, restaurants and 332 new homes on
OL,14,Fthe site of The Springs Shopping Centre
OL,15,Fin Buxton.
OL,17,FThe developer said the shopping centre
OL,18,Fneeds a new lease of life and the
OL,19,Fproject would help boost the town's
OL,20,Feconomy and make the area look more
OL,21,Fattractive.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,363,360,200,160,0,100
