OL,3,GNEWSACampaigners raise concern over
OL,4,A#100m redevelopment
OL,5,
OL,6,FA demonstration was held against the
OL,7,Fplans at the weekend, organised by
OL,8,Fresident Ruby Moon, who believes there
OL,9,Fis a "more sensitive way" to revamp the
OL,10,Ftown centre.
